# {{lb|en|anatomy}} A duct through which an [[ovum]] passes from an [[ovary]] to the [[uterus]] or to the exterior.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|Fallopian tube}}
* {{l|en|gonaduct}}
* {{l|en|salpinx}}
* {{l|en|uterine tube}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|oviducal}}
* {{l|en|oviductal}}

